<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 3.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 3.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Mar 3	 Feb 28     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  266.100     265.500     247.020    7.72 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  305.190     304.360     306.830   -0.53 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.300     156.840     158.970   -1.05 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.600	46.514	47.182   -1.23 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  431.900     432.260     419.180    3.03 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.890     139.545     141.685   -1.27 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.730	15.750	16.185   -2.81 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  220.750     220.360     212.430    3.92 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.854	 1.860	 1.888   -1.80 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.565	 1.563	 1.581   -1.01 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  180.340     179.700     183.135   -1.53%</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
